<title>NORWAY: Norway unemployment 4.5 percent in August.</title>
<headline>Norway unemployment 4.5 percent in August.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Labour directorate issued the following economic indicator.</p>
<p> NORWEGIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	 AUG 1996   JULY 1996    AUG 1995</p>
<p> Unemployment (in pct)	  4.5	     4.7	  5.2</p>
<p> Unemployed			 97,900	103,000     111,337</p>
<p>SEASONALLY ADJUSTED FIGURES</p>
<p> Unemployed			 90,100	 92,340     102,397</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
